# Compiled CmdStan binaries accidentally left in inst/legacy-scripts/ by a
# prior workflow (see inst/legacy-scripts/README.md) -- exclude the binaries
# specifically so they don't bloat the built package, while keeping the
# rest of inst/legacy-scripts/ (including the original .stan source) so
# system.file("legacy-scripts", package = "BayGMST") still resolves.
